    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίταξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a setting in array against,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ σφετέρα ἀ. τῶν τριήρων</span> their
			ships <i>ranged for battle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.17
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖσθαι πρός τινα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιτάσσεσθαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.8
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; <i>contest,</i> of bulls fighting, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				p.11A.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <i>opposition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				10.57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.663b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Andronic.
			</span></i> Rhod.<i><span class="en">
				p.572M.
			</span></i></div>
